LightVC — real-time voice conversion (MIT License)

Bundled model weights (models/v2f.bin) were trained on:
  - female-dataset (2775 real speakers)
  - irodori-tts corpus (669 speakers)

Third-party licenses:
  - CLAP plugin ABI: MIT
  - VST3 support via clap-wrapper: MIT
  - ASIO SDK is NOT included (proprietary; users must obtain it from Steinberg
    to build ASIO support themselves).

This distribution contains no GPLv3 dependencies.
